250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1423 0 R
/E (The courses are tailored by faculty with student feedback incorporated regularly, and the CfE team monitors classroom engagement for all courses. Most instructors are experienced industry professionals, ensuring 89% relevance for students and 95% alignment with market trends. A significant 30% of students choose Entrepreneurial \(ENT\) courses out of personal interest, while 27% seek essential skills for job placements, and 23% aspire to start their own ventures.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [12]
>>
endobj
