/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The beneficiary data shows greater participation of female students for the intended impact assessment of the Centre of Entrepreneurship \(CfE\). This is reflective of the general policy at Ashoka University focusing on Diversity, Equality, and Inclusion across all departments and categories. The two categories of beneficiaries interviewed from CfE were students pursuing undergraduate Majors and are still in college, and the other category consisted of the alumni of CfE who have just entered the job market this year or last year, making the insights and perspectives unique and nuanced.)
/E (The beneficiary data shows greater participation of female students for the intended impact assessment of the Centre of Entrepreneurship \(CfE\). This is reflective of the general policy at Ashoka University focusing on Diversity, Equality, and Inclusion across all departments and categories. The two categories of beneficiaries interviewed from CfE were students pursuing undergraduate Majors and are still in college, and the other category consisted of the alumni of CfE who have just entered the job market this year or last year, making the insights and perspectives unique and nuanced.)
