599 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Fig.4 represents that for many undergraduate students at Ashoka University, taking entrepreneurship courses is a big attraction, which is also evident from the high enrollment across the Monsoon and Spring semester of the Academic Year 2024-25. However, both Bachelor\(Major\) and Elective\(Minor/Concentration\) require dedicated effort and time. Therefore, many students end up taking entrepreneurship courses in their ASP years when their Major is completed. This is one of the main reasons why 100% of the respondents did not face challenges in balancing their academic Major commitments with their Minor ones.)
/E (Fig.4 represents that for many undergraduate students at Ashoka University, taking entrepreneurship courses is a big attraction, which is also evident from the high enrollment across the Monsoon and Spring semester of the Academic Year 2024-25. However, both Bachelor\(Major\) and Elective\(Minor/Concentration\) require dedicated effort and time. Therefore, many students end up taking entrepreneurship courses in their ASP years when their Major is completed. This is one of the main reasons why 100% of the respondents did not face challenges in balancing their academic Major commitments with their Minor ones.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [14]
>>
endobj
