/S /H4
/T (Quintinno Labs:  With two full-time employees and three interns, the company aims to launch its product in seven to eight months. It has received funding- the Nidhi-EiR grant from AIC - ISB Mohalli, and the grant from Emergent Ventures from Mercatus Center at George Mason University. The company recently received well-deserved attention at the Advantage Assam 2.0 Summit. Divas continues to be connected to the Entrepreneurial community at Ashoka with mentoring students during the most recent Startup Ashoka.*)
/E (Quintinno Labs:  With two full-time employees and three interns, the company aims to launch its product in seven to eight months. It has received funding- the Nidhi-EiR grant from AIC - ISB Mohalli, and the grant from Emergent Ventures from Mercatus Center at George Mason University. The company recently received well-deserved attention at the Advantage Assam 2.0 Summit. Divas continues to be connected to the Entrepreneurial community at Ashoka with mentoring students during the most recent Startup Ashoka.*)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K [10 11]
